+From: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
+Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 06:03:04 +0200
+Subject: [PATCH] ubus: wake the main loop while waiting to connect again
+
+After a lost UBus connection, the main loop calls ubus_init() again
+only when poll() returns. Without DNS or DHCP traffic nothing wakes
+poll(), so dnsmasq stays off the bus after a ubusd restart.
+
+Wake every second while the UBus connection is missing, as for a
+missing DBus connection.
+
+Signed-off-by: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
